{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜解讀APEC(三)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-19-13-40-44lvX73teD.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：解讀APEC</p><p>國家主席習近平在APEC發表講話，期望共同踐行真正的多邊主義，推動構建更公正全球治理體系，對中俄美元首會晤有何啟示？對全球大局有何影響？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港城市大學商學院客座教授陳鳳翔</p><p>智明研究所研究總監許楨</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:53:46.667085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.034270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:47:20.350588+00:00","content_hash":"ee173fdb5e6f45f300376e8fb1e79e4631eed056a0db740167e9ffada9e171ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:53:46.667085+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}